values ((select id from public.tenants where slug = 'demo'), 'icon-805-carling-1105', 'published', 'The Icon, 805 Carling Ave, Unit 1105', '805 Carling Ave', '1105', 'Ottawa', 'ON', 'K1S 5W9', 'Dow''s Lake / Little Italy', 'Condo apartment (11th floor)', 2400, 1, 1, '600–699', false, null, 'Allowed with restrictions (details to be confirmed)', 'In-suite', 'Central air conditioning', 'Forced air (natural gas)', 1, 'underground', array['heat', 'water']::text[], array['hydro', 'internet']::text[], array['24/7 concierge', 'Indoor pool', 'Sauna', 'Fitness centre', 'Yoga studio', 'Theatre room', 'Party rooms', 'Resident lounge', 'Outdoor terraces with BBQs']::text[], array['South-facing, direct view of Dow''s Lake and the canal', 'In the Claridge Icon, Ottawa''s tallest building', 'Floor-to-ceiling windows, hardwood floors, quartz counters, walk-in glass shower', 'All utilities included except hydro and internet']::text[], 'Balcony', 'Storage locker', 'Steps to the O-Train', '## About this home
A one-bedroom, one-bathroom condo on the 11th floor of the Claridge Icon, Ottawa''s tallest
building, at Carling and Preston. It faces south with a direct view of Dow''s Lake and the canal,
through floor-to-ceiling windows. Inside: hardwood floors, quartz counters, a walk-in glass
shower, and a balcony.

## Good fit for
- Someone who wants a view and a full-service building: 24/7 concierge, indoor pool, sauna,
  gym, yoga studio, theatre room, party rooms, resident lounge, and terraces with BBQs.
- Someone with one car: one underground parking spot, plus a storage locker.
- Anyone who wants air conditioning (central air).
- People who like being steps from Dow''s Lake, the canal pathways, Little Italy''s restaurants
  and cafés, and the O-Train, with easy access to Carleton, the Civic Hospital, and downtown.

## Good to know
- Rent is $2,400 a month. All utilities are included except hydro and internet.
- In-suite laundry.
- Pets are allowed with building restrictions; the specifics need to be confirmed with the
  leasing team.
- The availability date hasn''t been confirmed yet.', 'X13839592')
